  <item>
    <title>vol.11 唯美的琴音驱动，MitiS新EP《Through The Dark》reaction</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d3c187b977fb2c473afb44</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d3c187b977fb2c473afb44</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Apr 2026 14:28:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目为实时的</span><strong><span>Reaction</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期片头音乐为：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=1382942105&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX19zC8HL8ll+Pmo1R3zMUhCD+Be8KPeybb4=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=1382942105&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX19zC8HL8ll+Pmo1R3zMUhCD+Be8KPeybb4="><span>Alive (MitiS Remix)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期片尾音乐位：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=484365106&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1+th/ie0O/+S9ZcfjzO8B29Ri8IQSoX9NU=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=484365106&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1+th/ie0O/+S9ZcfjzO8B29Ri8IQSoX9NU="><span>Cold Skin (MitiS Remix)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期背景音乐为：</span><a href="https://www.streetvoice.cn/Radiant/songs/797837/" data-url="https://www.streetvoice.cn/Radiant/songs/797837/"><span>Love Place（Podcast Demo）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span><strong><span>ICYCLE</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>人物：</span><strong><span>MitiS </span></strong><span>是美国电子音乐制作人、DJ，本名 </span><strong><span>Joseph Torre</span></strong><span>。他出身于宾夕法尼亚州，早年接受过</span><strong><span>古典钢琴</span></strong><span>训练，这一点几乎定义了他的音乐气质：相比很多更强调“冲击力”的EDM 制作人，他的作品通常更偏</span><strong><span>旋律性、情绪化、电影感</span></strong><span>，经常把钢琴织体和旋律贝斯、</span><strong><span>future bass / melodic dubstep</span></strong><span> 融在一起。</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑：</span><strong><span>《Through The Dark》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>由 </span><strong><span>Ophelia Records</span></strong><span> 发行，</span><strong><span>2026</span></strong><span> 年 </span><strong><span>03</span></strong><span> 月 </span><strong><span>13</span></strong><span>日上线；全长</span><strong><span> 6 </span></strong><span>首、约 </span><strong><span>18</span></strong><span>分钟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>创作背景：</span></p><span></span><p><span>这张 EP 是在他</span><strong><span>父亲去世之后创作</span></strong><span>的作品，带有明显的个人情绪表达和纪念意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>官方/媒体普遍将其描述为他“</span><strong><span>最私人、最情绪化</span></strong><span>”的项目之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="164">02:44</a> 开场talk</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> </span><strong><span>A Good Day</span></strong><span> —— </span><strong><span>美好的一天</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> </span><strong><span>Awake</span></strong><span> —— </span><strong><span>醒来</span></strong><span> / </span><strong><span>清醒</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> </span><strong><span>Wilderness</span></strong><span> —— </span><strong><span>荒野</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> </span><strong><span>Through The Dark</span></strong><span> —— </span><strong><span>穿越黑暗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a> </span><strong><span>Take Me Back</span></strong><span> —— </span><strong><span>带我回去</span></strong><span> / </span><strong><span>带我回到从前</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> </span><strong><span>Both Of Us</span></strong><span> —— </span><strong><span>我们两个人</span></strong><span> / </span><strong><span>你我二人</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmS_yAKCvCuMDjBTf9gLFLKpIvsT.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/672c9e9fe14b836d5d734c4c/ln5eTQq-SwgmQWQiqJqJL109adQ1.m4a" length="48337315" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkYKvJA8gIaCmrWX-ZO5Wykll8cJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
