    <title>vol.10 中二的BASS系，7狮新碟《Asleep in the Garden of Infernal Stars》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69cd257de2c8be315521faf1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69cd257de2c8be315521faf1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 14:58:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目为实时的Reaction</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期片头音乐为：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=1433426227&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1/Q7Y4y8RKtMEtSob34f2jKeUKBBtQZDoE=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=1433426227&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1/Q7Y4y8RKtMEtSob34f2jKeUKBBtQZDoE="><span>《Another way》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期背景音乐为：</span><a href="https://www.streetvoice.cn/Radiant/songs/797837/" data-url="https://www.streetvoice.cn/Radiant/songs/797837/"><span>Love Place（Podcast Demo）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span><strong><span>ICYCLE</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>专辑：《</span><strong><span>Asleep in the Garden of Infernal Stars</span></strong><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>由 </span><strong><span>Ophelia Records</span></strong><span> 发行，</span><strong><span>2025 年 12 月 12 日</span></strong><span>上线；全长 </span><strong><span>11 首、约 44 分钟</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人物：</span><strong><span>Seven Lions</span></strong><span> /是美国电子音乐制作人、DJ，本名 Jeff Montalvo，来自加州圣塔芭芭拉。很多人把他归到“melodic dubstep（旋律性 dubstep）/ melodic bass”这一路，但他其实一直不是只做一种风格的人：他的作品里经常把 trance、dubstep、psytrance、drum &amp; bass、progressive house 这些元素揉在一起。</span></p><span></span><p><span>曲目</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. Asleep in the Garden of Infernal Stars</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>沉睡于炼狱群星之园</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2. Breaking Me</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>将我击溃</span></strong><span> / </span><strong><span>让我崩溃</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. Delusional</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>妄想</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>4. By the Light of the Moon</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>借着月光</span></strong><span> / </span><strong><span>在月光之下</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>5. A Crown of Seven Suns</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>七阳之冠</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>6. From Beyond</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>来自彼界</span></strong><span> / </span><strong><span>来自彼岸之外</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>7. So Far Away</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>如此遥远</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>8. Cold as Snow</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>冷若霜雪</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>9. Past You</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>走过你之后</span></strong><span> / </span><strong><span>越过你</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>10. Thrice Woven</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>三重织就</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>11. Breathe It Out Slowly</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>慢慢呼出</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3k36koz8vsjPTKDYYt8cJD9DHf.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
