  <item>
    <title>vol.9 由夯到拉，凤凰之子ILLENIUM最新专辑《ODYSSEY》Reaction</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698ab35366e2c30377c245c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698ab35366e2c30377c245c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 04:50:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客是和朋友的一场闲聊，我和我的朋友</span><strong><span>ICYCLE</span></strong><span>对凤凰之子</span><strong><span>ILLENIUM</span></strong><span>在2026年2月6日发布的大碟</span><strong><span>《ODYSSEY》</span></strong><span>进行了一个实时的Reaction。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期背景音乐：</span></strong></em><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=3330491533&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1870UO0VbtVndgzC8VrsiiAVP5Sky/x0zU=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=3330491533&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1870UO0VbtVndgzC8VrsiiAVP5Sky/x0zU="><span>二周目</span></a><span> - Radiant. &nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.streetvoice.cn/Radiant/songs/797837/" data-url="https://www.streetvoice.cn/Radiant/songs/797837/"><span>Love Place（Podcast Demo）</span></a><span> - Radiant.</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期播客中所提到的艺术家：</span></strong></em><span>ILLENIUM凤凰之子，Seven Lionsq七狮，Subtronics眼哥，Said The Sky天诉，Excision霸王龙，Ellie Goulding绵羊音，Ryan Tedder共和时代主唱，Zeds Dead，Dabin，Dean Lewis，Alok，Alan Walker, San Holo, &nbsp;MADEON, DJ小女孩。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 开场闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> Odyssey</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> Into The Dark</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> Forever</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> With Your Love</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> Feels Like You</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> In My Arms</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2739">45:39</a> Don't Want Your Love</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> Slave to the Rithm</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3469">57:49</a> War</span></p><spa